Sval: Remove Firefox's profile backup

Firefox's backup archived a profile into a "Restore Firefox" folder and
restored one from it. Sval keeps its data in one directory of its own
and backs up its sync key itself, so the component goes whole: the
service and its resources, its startup task, the Settings section that
offered it on Windows and Linux, its actor, the BrowserDataBackup
policy, the messaging targeting attributes that read it, its prefs,
Nimbus feature, strings, metrics and tests.

